# Everything the image builds for itself, or must not inherit from a developer's machine.
#
# node_modules is 1.6G and holds binaries compiled for whatever laptop installed them; copied
# into a linux image they are both the slowest part of the build and the wrong architecture.
# `npm ci` in the Dockerfile installs the same versions for the image's own platform.
node_modules
dist
.git
.DS_Store
*.log
.env
.env.*
coverage
.vscode
.idea
